  "answer": "**答案：Palazzo della Cancelleria（宗座文书院宫 / 大法院宫）**\n\n这是罗马第一座完全从零开始、按新文艺复兴风格兴建的宫殿，建于约 1489–1513 年，由枢机 Raffaele Riario 委托建造（建筑师说法不一，常提到 Bramante 参与）。\n\n依据：\n- https://www.alamy.de/stockfoto-eingang-des-palazzo-delle-cancelleria-in-rom-italien-19135658.html（\"the first palazzo in Rome to be built from the ground up in the new Renaissance style\"）\n- https://wcsiasc.org/formal-award-ceremony-12-of-october/（\"the first palazzo in Rome to be erected from the ground up in the new Renaissance style\"）\n- https://www.britannica.com/place/Cancelleria",
